# tests/fixtures/snmpsim/data/switch.snmprec
# Simulated L3 switch (community/context "switch"): system group + IF-MIB
# ifTable + ifXTable with HC 64-bit octet counters and 32-bit error/discard
# counters. Interface 1's HC counters sit just below the 64-bit ceiling and
# its ifInErrors just below the 32-bit ceiling; the "swrap" fixture continues
# the same device after a counter wrap (no reboot) for the P2-AC-16
# integration scenario (in_octets modular delta = 75 B, out_octets = 1619 B,
# in_errors = 7). Values are static; the counter state machine derives rates
# from the delta between two polls.
#
# TYPE codes (snmpsim .snmprec): 2=INTEGER, 4=STRING, 6=OBJECT IDENTIFIER,
# 65=Counter32, 66=Gauge32, 67=TimeTicks, 70=Counter64.

# --- system group ---------------------------------------------------------
